<?php /** @var \Sysfera\Plugin $sf @var \SysferaStoragerent\Ctx $ctx @var string $lang @var array $meters @var array $units @var array $readings @var int $meterId @var bool $canWrite @var bool $tariff @var string $today @var array $types */
require __DIR__ . '/_nav.php'; ?>
<?php if (!$meters): ?><div class="card empty"><?= e($sf->t('util_none')) ?></div><?php else: ?>
<div class="card sr-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th><?= e($sf->t('col_unit')) ?></th><th><?= e($sf->t('f_meter_type')) ?></th><th><?= e($sf->t('f_serial')) ?></th><th class="r"><?= e($sf->t('f_meter_rate')) ?></th><th><?= e($sf->t('util_last')) ?></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach ($meters as $m): ?><tr class="<?= (int)$m['id'] === $meterId ? 'sel' : '' ?>"><td><?= e($m['unit_name']) ?></td><td><?= e($sf->t('meter_' . $m['type'])) ?></td><td><?= e($m['serial']) ?></td><td class="r"><?= e(sr_m($m['rate'], $lang)) ?></td>
  <td><?= $m['last'] ? e(sr_num($m['last']['value'])) . ' · ' . e(sr_d($m['last']['read_date'])) : '—' ?></td><td><a class="btn sm" href="<?= e($sf->url('/utilities?meter=' . $m['id'])) ?>"><?= e($sf->t('util_readings')) ?></a></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if ($meterId > 0): ?><div class="card"><h3><?= e($sf->t('util_readings')) ?></h3>
<?php if ($readings): ?><table><thead><tr><th><?= e($sf->t('col_date')) ?></th><th class="r"><?= e($sf->t('f_value')) ?></th><th class="r"><?= e($sf->t('col_consumption')) ?></th><th class="r"><?= e($sf->t('col_charge')) ?></th><th><?= e($sf->t('col_status')) ?></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<?php foreach ($readings as $r): ?><tr><td><?= e(sr_d($r['read_date'])) ?></td><td class="r"><?= e(sr_num($r['value'])) ?></td><td class="r"><?= e(sr_num($r['consumption'])) ?></td><td class="r"><?= e(sr_m($r['charge'], $lang)) ?></td><td><?= $r['billed_invoice_id'] ? '<a href="' . e($sf->url('/invoice/' . $r['billed_invoice_id'])) . '">' . e($sf->t('util_billed')) . '</a>' : e($sf->t('util_unbilled')) ?></td>
  <td><?= $r['photo_doc_id'] ? '<a href="' . e($sf->url('/doc/' . $r['photo_doc_id'])) . '">' . e($sf->t('util_photo')) . '</a>' : '' ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table><?php else: ?><p class="muted"><?= e($sf->t('none')) ?></p><?php endif; ?>
<?php if ($canWrite): ?><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="<?= e($sf->url('/utilities/reading')) ?>" class="sr-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="meter_id" value="<?= $meterId ?>">
  <div class="sr-2"><?= sr_in('date', $sf->t('col_date'), $today, 'date', 'required') ?><?= sr_in('value', $sf->t('f_value'), '', 'text', 'required inputmode="decimal"') ?></div>
  <label class="fld"><span><?= e($sf->t('util_photo')) ?></span><input type="file" name="photo" accept="image/*" capture="environment"></label><button class="btn primary"><?= e($sf->t('util_add_reading')) ?></button></form><?php endif; ?></div><?php endif; ?>
<?php if ($tariff): ?><form method="post" action="<?= e($sf->url('/utilities/meter')) ?>" class="card sr-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><h3><?= e($sf->t('util_new_meter')) ?></h3><p class="muted sm"><?= e($sf->t('util_meter_help')) ?></p>
  <div class="sr-2"><?= sr_sel('unit_id', $sf->t('col_unit'), $units, 0) ?><?= sr_sel('type', $sf->t('f_meter_type'), array_combine($types, array_map(fn($x) => $sf->t('meter_' . $x), $types)), 'electricity') ?></div>
  <div class="sr-2"><?= sr_in('serial', $sf->t('f_serial'), '', 'text', 'maxlength="60"') ?><?= sr_in('rate', $sf->t('f_meter_rate'), '', 'text', 'inputmode="decimal"') ?></div><?= sr_in('rollover', $sf->t('f_rollover'), '', 'text', 'inputmode="decimal"') ?><button class="btn primary"><?= e($sf->t('save')) ?></button></form><?php endif; ?>
